  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forskningsst&#xf6;d till BecA-ILRI Hub Nov 2012 - Jun 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research Support to BecA-ILRI Hub Nov 2012 - Jun 2017 - Support to BecA - Climate change 2012-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forskningsst&#xf6;d till Bioscience eastern and central Africa -          International Livestock Research Institute, BecA-ILRI Hub g&#xe4;llande    insatserna i) &quot;Climate-smart Brachiaria grasses for improving         livestock production in East Africa&quot; avseende perioden november 2012- december 2015 och ii)Extra st&#xf6;d tillLivsmedelss&#xe4;kerhet och klimat     program samt bas st&#xf6;d november 2013- december 2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research support to the Bioscience eastern and central Africa -       International Livestock Research Institute (BecA-ILRI)Hub regarding   i)Climate-smart Brachiaria for increased livestock productivity in    East Africa November 2012- December 2015 and (ii)Support to Food      security &amp; program and core activities at BecA-ILRI Hub to accelerate research output towards africa led Impact Nov 2013- Dec2014.</narrative>
  </description>
